{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20490","headline":"酬李仆射晚春见寄 · 张籍","name":"酬李仆射晚春见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戟户洞初晨，莺声雨後频。\n虚庭清气在，衆药湿光新。\n鱼动芳池面，苔侵老竹身。\n教铺尝酒处，自问探花人。\n独此长多病，幽居欲过春。\n今朝听高韵，忽觉离埃尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}